    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Parses any one of a set of strings.</para><para>Recognizes any of the strings register via <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1StringSetParser_1a02d981f759143bd39529237ec58c24cd" kindref="member">with</ref> method and returns a <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1ParsedValue" kindref="compound">ParsedValue</ref> of type <computeroutput>std::string</computeroutput> for the string that was matched. Longer matches are preferred over shorter matches; if the input contains &quot;bandana&quot; and the parser knows about &quot;ban&quot;, &quot;band&quot;, and &quot;bandana&quot;, it will match &quot;bandana&quot;. The return value is a <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1ParsedValue" kindref="compound">ParsedValue</ref> whose value is an <computeroutput>std::string</computeroutput>.</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__sawyer__parser__factories" kindref="compound">Command line parser factories</ref> </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
